  "title": "Prompting-MammAlps: Fine-Grained Text-to-Video Retrieval for Camera-Trap Data",
  "summary": "Prompting-MammAlps introduces a camera-trap TVR benchmark that leverages a vision transformer for spatiotemporal action localization and a LLM-based parsing system to enhance interpretability, achieving a 34% F1-score on a test set of 135 ecologically-relevant queries.",
